  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "Incremental cost-effectiveness plane for South Africa (part of Figure 2): a scatter plot of Monte Carlo simulations with Incremental QALYs on the x-axis (−2 to 2) and Incremental Costs on the y-axis (about −50 to 100), comparing DiaskinTest versus PPD-TST (blue) and DiaskinTest versus IGRA (green). The green points (versus IGRA) lie mostly above zero cost, around 50, while the blue points (versus PPD-TST) are centred near zero cost.",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
